PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555124
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FAn 18-year-old student stabbed a man
OL,8,Ffrom another university five times in
OL,9,Fthe chest, including once in the
OL,10,Fheart, over a debt, a court has heard.
OL,12,FLeicester Crown Court was told Harper
OL,13,FDennis, 18, fell out with Khaleed
OL,14,FOladipo, 20, over money before
OL,15,Fplunging a knife 13cm-deep into him
OL,16,Fnear De Montfort University in
OL,17,FFebruary this year.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FThe defendant, who is charged with
OL,8,Fmurder, having an article with a blade
OL,9,For point and failing to provide the
OL,10,FPin for his phone, sat in the dock
OL,11,Fwhile prosecutor Jane Osborne KC
OL,12,Falleged on Monday that Mr Oladipo had
OL,13,Fbeen killed by his former friend.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FOpening the Crown's case, Ms Osborne
OL,8,Ftold the jury: "It was the 3rd of
OL,9,FFebruary this year, 2026, shortly
OL,10,Fafter 5pm, on a wet evening in
OL,11,FLeicester, near to the university
OL,12,Fcampus, where Khaleed Oladipo, who was
OL,13,Fa student at De Montfort University,
OL,14,Fwas stabbed.
OL,16,F"He was stabbed not once, but a number
OL,17,Fof times. Only one of those stab
OL,18,Fwounds was fatal. That one fatal wound
OL,19,Funfortunately penetrated his heart."
OL,26,@pD@POUxD@AOU{D@dO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FMs Osborne told the court that Mr
OL,8,FOladipo collapsed in the street and
OL,9,Fnever regained consciousness.
OL,11,FShe continued: "Khaleed Oladipo was
OL,12,Fkilled not by a stranger, but by
OL,13,Fsomebody who knew him.
OL,15,F"Khaleed Oladipo and Harper Dennis,
OL,16,Fthis defendant, knew each other from
OL,17,Fonline gaming.
OL,26,@sD@POUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,F"Whereas Khaleed Oladipo was in his
OL,8,Fthird year at De Montfort University,
OL,9,FHarper Dennis was in his first year at
OL,10,Fthe University of Leicester.
OL,12,F"They had previously been friends.
OL,13,FThey were part of a Snapchat group
OL,14,Ftogether, but there had been a falling
OL,15,Fout seemingly over money that, at the
OL,16,Fvery least, Harper Dennis perceived
OL,17,Fwas owed to him by Khaleed Oladipo.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,F"It would seem the perceived debt was
OL,8,Fthe reason that Harper Dennis attacked
OL,9,FKhaleed Oladipo in the street on the
OL,10,F3rd of February."
OL,12,FThe prosecutor said Khaleed Oladipo
OL,13,Fand Harper Dennis were both in Oxford
OL,14,FStreet, close to De Montfort
OL,15,FUniversity's Innovation Centre, when
OL,16,Fthe stabbing, which was captured on
OL,17,Fdashcam footage, happened.
OL,19,FMs Osborne added that the two men
OL,20,Fengaged in a "short struggle" before
OL,21,Fthey both went to the floor.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@QO]|D@NOU|D@]O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FThe prosecutor told the court the
OL,8,Ffootage shows the defendant's arm in a
OL,9,F"backwards and forwards" motion,
OL,10,F"consistent with the stab wounds
OL,11,Finflicted to the left hand side of
OL,12,FKhaleed Oladipo's chest".
OL,14,FShe added: "Having been stabbed,
OL,15,FKhaleed Oladipo rises to his knees and
OL,16,Fthe defendant runs off.
OL,18,F"He isn't pursued. It's clear Khaleed
OL,19,FOladipo is not capable of pursuing
OL,20,FHarper Dennis."
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@XO]rD@AOUtD@XO]vD@LOUzD@AOU|D@
OL,26,AOO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FMs Osborne added: "It was an incident
OL,8,Fthat lasted, in reality, seconds."
OL,10,FA witness who had been driving in
OL,11,Ftraffic recalled seeing a "snowstorm
OL,12,Fof feathers from one of their coats"
OL,13,Fduring the altercation, Ms Osborne
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FThe woman got out of her car to help
OL,17,FMr Oladipo, the jury heard, and saw a
OL,18,Fknife "parallel" to where he lay on
OL,19,Fthe ground.
OL,26,@oD@SOUpD@bO]sD@[OUtD@dO]zD@GOUzD@PO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FMs Osborne told jurors Mr Oladipo's
OL,8,Fcause of death was a 13cm-deep stab
OL,9,Fwound to the left side of his chest
OL,10,Fwhich went into his heart.
OL,12,FThe prosecutor said there were four
OL,13,Fother stab wounds to his chest area,
OL,14,Fwhich did not contribute to his death,
OL,15,Fwhile a defensive wound was found on
OL,16,Fhis hand.
OL,18,FMs Osborne told the jury two calls
OL,19,Fwere made by Dennis to Mr Oladipo's
OL,20,Fgirlfriend Shekeizah Fowler-Palmer on
OL,21,FChristmas Day last year.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FThe barrister said: "The caller said
OL,8,Fto her Khaleed was a bad guy and that
OL,9,FKhaleed owed him #3,000. That caller
OL,10,Fintimated if Khaleed did not give the
OL,11,Fmoney, he, the caller, would come to
OL,12,Fher."
OL,14,FMs Osborne said there was an occasion
OL,15,Fwhen Mr Oladipo gave Dennis a watch to
OL,16,Fsell and advised him not to go to
OL,17,Fcertain jewellers because it was a
OL,18,Ffake Rolex.
OL,26,@oD@UOUtD@EO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FWhen Dennis went to sell the watch, he
OL,8,Fwas "laughed at" because it was fake
OL,9,Fand was "embarrassed and angry" with
OL,10,FMr Oladipo, jurors were told.
OL,12,FThe prosecutor said messages between
OL,13,Fthe two suggest they had fallen out
OL,14,Ffor an unknown reason, including one
OL,15,Ffrom Dennis which said he "won't ever
OL,16,Fforget" what Mr Oladipo did.
OL,26,@pD@EOUpD@PO]qD@IOUqD@_O]wD@[OUxD@GO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G11/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786555125
OL,3,CStudent stabbed man five times in
OL,4,Cheart near campus over debt, trial
OL,5,Chears
OL,7,FIn a Snapchat message from Dennis to
OL,8,FMr Oladipo on Boxing Day last year, he
OL,9,Fsaid he would "dedicate his life to
OL,10,Fmaking sure you suffer for what you
OL,11,Fdid", the court heard.
OL,13,FDennis, of North Road in West Drayton,
OL,14,FLondon, denies the charges against him.
OL,16,FThe trial, which is expected to last
OL,17,Fthree weeks, continues.
OL,26,@qD@OOUsD@DO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G12/12
